# %% [markdown]
# # 04 - Generate Label Files
#
# This notebook generates the label files required for Azure DI training:
# - `fields.json` - Schema defining all extractable fields
# - `*.labels.json` - Labels for each training image
#
# Labels are generated by matching OCR words to template zones.

# %%
# Standard imports
